Upstream: https://github.com/LilMGenius/paperthin @ 7d5dc62
Paths: skills/depth/shower/SKILL.md (ported as cold-read)

Modifications: rewritten rather than copied, with a descriptive name in place
of the upstream one, our section order, no em-dashes and no references to
sibling skills. Kept rules: the read comes from a separate context-free
subagent and is never self-assessed; the artifact's contents are passed, never
a path or the intent; "I had to assume" counts as a finding; read end to end,
never report clean from a grep; one read by default and several when stakes
justify it; defects ordered by how badly they block a fresh reader with a
stands-alone, minor-gaps or needs-work verdict; diagnose only, fixes happen in
the main session. Added "Not for" lines naming doubt-review and docs-audit.
